<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="10190e35">&lt;p&gt;
    Identify and allocate remaining tasks from previous sprints and balance the workload for the upcoming sprints. A
    capacity analysis is usually performed to adjust workloads within and across workstreams and is usually performed in
    preparation for prioritizing tasks in sprint planning discussions at the beginning of each sprint.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
